This is a sample text to SQL Assistant App. This helps the user to trigger the prompt which will return schema specific query to generate
and also finally return the output in the UI. Thus generally uses below techstack.

OpenAI, llm, python, mysql, streamlit

How to run this program
=======================
1) import the Project to ur IDE
2) Set the Virtual environment usig below command
    python -m venv myenv

3)Activate the virutal environment using the below command
  .\myenv\Scripts\activate forwindows machine

4) Next install all the required libraries from requirement.txt file using the below command.
   pip install -r .\requirements.txt
5) Next run the application using the below command
   streamlit run app.py

There is one file main.py which also u can run but that will show the result in console. run it as a simple python file.